@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "- Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-12 col-lg-8">

        <h1 class="text-danger fw-bold mb-1">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-muted mb-4">Last updated: Sept 2026</p>

        <p>
            TubeTrans is a free tool that lets you view the transcript of a public
            YouTube video. This page explains, in plain terms, what happens with
            your information when you use the site.
        </p>

        <hr class="border-danger opacity-25 my-4" />

        <h2 class="h5 fw-bold">No accounts, no personal data</h2>
        <p>
            You don't need to sign up to use TubeTrans. We don't collect names,
            email addresses, or any personal identifying information.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h5 fw-bold">We don't store your searches</h2>
        <p>
            Every request is processed on the fly, only in server memory for the
            duration of that request, and discarded right after the result is
            shown to you. No history of consulted videos is kept.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h5 fw-bold">Third-party services</h2>
        <p>
            To fetch a transcript, our server requests public video information
            directly from YouTube. This means YouTube receives a request from our
            infrastructure for each lookup, subject to
            <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-danger">
                Google/YouTube's Privacy Policy
            </a>.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h5 fw-bold">Cookies</h2>
        <p>
            The site may use a strictly necessary technical cookie for form
            security (CSRF protection). We don't use tracking, advertising, or
            third-party analytics cookies.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h5 fw-bold">Server logs</h2>
        <p>
            Like any website, our hosting provider may automatically log basic
            technical information for each request (such as IP address and
            timestamp), used only for security and error diagnosis purposes.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h5 fw-bold">Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
            If this policy changes, this page will be updated with the
            corresponding date.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h5 fw-bold">Contact</h2>
        <p>
            Questions about this policy can be sent to
            <a href="mailto:wilgm211@gmail.com" class="text-danger">wilgm211@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>

    </div>
</div>